cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this calculator, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "EVO ICL postoperative vault calculator"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-05
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A single-page research calculator for postoperative vault after EVO
  Implantable Collamer Lens (ICL) implantation. It applies a locked
  five-variable linear model of 1-month vault, plus a separate orientation
  term, and shows uncertainty, safety notices, and a published-formula
  cross-check. Research prototype: not clinically validated and not a
  medical device.
authors:
